      "content": "\"letting go\" sounds nice, but it also feels scary. like, what if letting go means there's nothing left? i'm just so tired of fighting to keep these lights on when it feels like they're just gonna burn out anyway. it feels like such a struggle just to exist as someone i don't even recognize anymore.",
